## json5/json5-tests — Parse Test Cases for JSON5

The conformance tests reproduce a subset of the official corpus published at
https://github.com/json5/json5-tests, pinned at commit
`ceb24d4080137d70833f86c25659c1331b80a387` (2026-02-19):

  * vendored verbatim under `src/testdata/json5-tests/` (112 fixture files:
    `arrays/`, `comments/`, `misc/`, `new-lines/`, `numbers/`, `objects/`,
    `strings/`)
  * driven mechanically by `src/json5_tests_vectors.zig` (one entry per file,
    `@embedFile`d) and `src/json5_tests_test.zig` (the runner)

Excluded from vendoring, deliberately: the repository's own `.git/`,
`README.md`, `LICENSE.md` metadata; the `.errorSpec` companion files (exact
reference-parser error positions, not needed to assert pass/reject); and the
upstream `todo/` directory (two cases the corpus's own authors have not yet
asserted a verdict for, and which additionally require Unicode-escape support
this module does not implement).

